cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TCGA Breast Cancer Gene Expression Analysis Pipeline"
abstract: "A comprehensive R-based bioinformatics pipeline for analyzing differential gene expression in HER2/ERBB2-amplified breast cancer using TCGA Pan-Cancer Atlas RNA-seq data. The pipeline integrates differential expression analysis (DESeq2), pathway enrichment (clusterProfiler), and survival prediction using LASSO-regularized Cox regression."
